{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marsh delves into a new adventure... <strong>and some new dimensions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/3e7a91a17fded951f0d607c10de0e858.poster.avif?t=1774627761\" width=388 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/3e7a91a17fded951f0d607c10de0e858.webm?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/3e7a91a17fded951f0d607c10de0e858.mp4?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marsh Into the New Dimension is a thrilling and quirky 3D boss-rush platformer adventure game travelling through brand new worlds and meeting new friends to help you save the universe from unwanted destruction. <strong>With a fresh new and original soundtrack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with new friends to help you take these corrupted entities out one by one and explore all these never before seen dimensions. <strong>Including a fun, addicting and replayable minigame for each world for you to battle out for them top scores.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/c7fa50df03bc6721a1edc19131a0926f.poster.avif?t=1774627761\" width=330 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/c7fa50df03bc6721a1edc19131a0926f.webm?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/c7fa50df03bc6721a1edc19131a0926f.mp4?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete new 360 movement around an all new free roam map to explore, collect items and talk to various characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/8f085e2fc5137409f2749b8078cd482c.poster.avif?t=1774627761\" width=668 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/8f085e2fc5137409f2749b8078cd482c.webm?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100550/extras/8f085e2fc5137409f2749b8078cd482c.mp4?t=1774627761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Little Pebble Land","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/ed061f7f104ca91908a092dc5392d4391e984629.jpg"},{"name":"Acreyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/c49f0b9151ce7e33a4e8ed018dc108b803801be5.jpg"},{"name":"Glucose Uni","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/bd9cc1fe3a99a714ed0c8b575b8131b1a6c619de.jpg"},{"name":"Bunker Range","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/28884b2604e9bcac64a72699847ff74a1295b448.jpg"},{"name":"The Feedhouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/ceed156efd16886fa489d5ac056a9c4595bda724.jpg"},{"name":"Morass Mineshaft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/60f5ba8173e6e38e0d1690bd9279bd1e81bf0e6c.jpg"},{"name":"The Present Is Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4100550/f4109dadb9398981c544ca3122a1202bcb50